#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1468 expect=skipped domain=EX
#note "Plan B phase 4c: the rule declares Requirements.Datasets [EC] instead of an authored ds_exists(\"EC\") conjunct, so a run without EC is UNANSWERABLE, not answered-false. RuleRunner checks the requirement at the Requirements gate, BEFORE AbsentDatasetSkip.decide, and the verdict moves noViolation -> skipped. That status move is the whole of 4c's finding-movement budget: zero finding rows move (this scenario reported none before)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset EX class=INTERVENTIONS
col STUDYID type=Char
col DOMAIN  type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col EXSEQ   type=Num
col EXTRT   type=Char
col EXVAMT  type=Num
---
S1 | EX | 001 | 1 | DRUGA | 10
